d of birdwatching with wildlife cameraman Hamza Yassin - winner of BBC One's Strictly Come Dancing 2022 and presenter of BBC documentary Hamza: Strictly Birds of Prey 'Birds have been with me my entire life - from the colourful weaver birds on the banks of the Nile in Sudan to the magpies of Newcastle, from the roosting peregrine falcons near my parents' house in Northampton to the white-tailed eagles on the west coast of Scotland. I love them. If you take the time to stop and listen, you'll see the world through different eyes. It's all out there, waiting for you to find it. And it might just bring you as much joy as it's brought me.'","thumbnailUrl":"/book-covers/book-be-a-birder-my-love-of-birdwatching-and-how-to-get-started-hamza-yassin.jpg","readerProfile":{"readerLevel":"crossover","narrativeScore":0,"accessibilityScore":0,"scholarlyScore":0,"traits":[],"method":"deterministic_catalog_heuristics_v1"},"experimentalSemanticProfile":{"centralFigures":[],"centralPlaces":[],"argument":{"present":false,"statement":"","confidence":0},"academicOrientation":{"score":30,"confidence":0.44},"profileConfidence":0.74,"lowerConfidenceCandidates":{"centralPlaces":[{"name":"Nile","confidence":0.42},{"name":"Newcastle","confidence":0.38},{"name":"Scotland","confidence":0.36}],"argument":{"statement":"Birdwatching, by stopping to listen, lets you see the world differently and can bring you joy like it has brought Hamza Yassin.","confidence":0.56}},"model":"gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17","promptVersion":8,"inputHash":"0c637f69590308ac99778f1600bfebb8a87d75d52d7ca1ae0ea7d2476e94dd12","reviewStatus":"unreviewed","validationWarnings":[]},"displaySummary":"I love them. If you take the time to stop and listen, you'll see the world through different eyes. It's all out there, waiting for you to find it. And it might just bring you as much joy as it's brought me.'","primarySubject":"Nature & Environment","primaryTopic":"Environment, Conservation & Pollution","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject"